#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:2
msgid "Quick Start"
msgstr "快速开始"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:4
msgid ""
"This guide walks through installing the C23 toolchain on Windows, adding "
"the official project templates, choosing between the **declarative** and "
"**imperative** tracks, and building and running your first **Xent 0.3.3**"
" application."
msgstr ""
"本指南介绍如何在 Windows 上安装 C23 工具链、添加官方项目模板、在 **声明式** 与 "
"**命令式** 两条路线之间做出选择，以及编译并运行第一个 **Xent 0.3.3** 应用程序。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:10
msgid "Step 1: Install the Toolchain"
msgstr "第 1 步：安装工具链"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:12
msgid ""
"Building a Xent C application on Windows requires **Windows 10 version "
"1903 or later**, ``git``, **Xmake 3.1.2+**, and the **llvm-mingw** C23 "
"compiler toolchain."
msgstr ""
"在 Windows 上构建 Xent C 应用需要 **Windows 10 1903 及以上版本** 、 ``git`` 、 "
"**Xmake 3.1.2+** 以及 **llvm-mingw** C23 编译工具链。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:16
msgid ""
"**Install Xmake (3.1.2 or newer)**: Follow the official `Xmake "
"Installation Guide <https://xmake.io/guide/quick-start.html>`__, and "
"install `Git <https://git-scm.com/>`__ so Xmake can fetch package "
"repositories."
msgstr ""
"**安装 Xmake（3.1.2 及以上版本）** ：按照官方 `Xmake 安装指南 <https://xmake.io/guide/quick-start.html>`__ "
"完成安装，并安装 `Git <https://git-scm.com/>`__ 以便 Xmake 拉取依赖仓库。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:19
msgid ""
"**Install llvm-mingw (UCRT)**: Xent uses ``llvm-mingw`` Clang as its "
"primary C23 toolchain on Windows. Visit `mstorsjo/llvm-mingw "
"<https://github.com/mstorsjo/llvm-mingw>`__ and download the latest "
"Windows-native **UCRT** ``.zip`` archive for your architecture from "
"`llvm-mingw Releases <https://github.com/mstorsjo/llvm-"
"mingw/releases>`__:"
msgstr ""
"**安装 llvm-mingw（UCRT 版）** ：Xent 在 Windows 上以 ``llvm-mingw`` Clang 作为主力 C23 工具链。"
"前往官方仓库 `mstorsjo/llvm-mingw <https://github.com/mstorsjo/llvm-mingw>`__ ，从 "
"`llvm-mingw Releases <https://github.com/mstorsjo/llvm-mingw/releases>`__ 下载对应架构的 "
"Windows 原生 **UCRT** ``.zip`` 压缩包："

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:25
msgid "64-bit x86 Windows: ``llvm-mingw-<date>-ucrt-x86_64.zip``"
msgstr "64 位 x86 Windows： ``llvm-mingw-<date>-ucrt-x86_64.zip``"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:26
msgid "Windows on ARM: ``llvm-mingw-<date>-ucrt-aarch64.zip``"
msgstr "ARM64 Windows： ``llvm-mingw-<date>-ucrt-aarch64.zip``"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:28
msgid ""
"Extract the archive to a permanent directory (for example ``C:\\llvm-"
"mingw``) and add its ``bin`` folder (``C:\\llvm-mingw\\bin``) to your "
"user ``PATH``."
msgstr ""
"将压缩包解压到固定目录（例如 ``C:\\llvm-mingw`` ），并将其中的 ``bin`` 目录"
"（ ``C:\\llvm-mingw\\bin`` ）加入当前用户的 ``PATH`` 环境变量。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:31
msgid ""
"Open a new terminal window and verify that all three commands report "
"their versions:"
msgstr "重新打开一个终端窗口，验证以下三条命令均能输出版本号："

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:41
msgid "Step 2: Install the Project Templates"
msgstr "第 2 步：安装项目模板"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:43
msgid ""
"Project Xent distributes ready-to-build C23 project templates as an "
"`Xmake Addon "
"<https://xmake.io/guide/extensions/addons/installation.html>`__. Install "
"the ``xent-repo`` addon once for your user account and list the available"
" templates:"
msgstr ""
"Project Xent 通过 `Xmake Addon <https://xmake.io/guide/extensions/addons/installation.html>`__ "
"分发开箱即用的 C23 工程模板。为当前用户安装一次 ``xent-repo`` 插件并查看可用模板列表："

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:52
msgid "Under language ``c``, two Fluxent templates are available:"
msgstr "在 ``c`` 语言分类下包含两个 Fluxent 工程模板："

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:54
msgid "``fluxent.decl`` — Declarative application (``flux_run``)"
msgstr "``fluxent.decl`` —— 声明式应用模板（ ``flux_run`` ）"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:55
msgid "``fluxent.imp`` — Imperative application (``XtkScene`` / ``XtkTxn``)"
msgstr "``fluxent.imp`` —— 命令式应用模板（ ``XtkScene`` / ``XtkTxn`` ）"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:58
msgid "Step 3: Declarative vs. Imperative — Comparison & How to Choose"
msgstr "第 3 步：声明式与命令式——对比与选型"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:60
msgid ""
"Both ``fluxent.decl`` and ``fluxent.imp`` share the same retained Fluxent"
" host, native Direct2D/DirectWrite controls, accessibility support, and "
"atomic ``XtkBatch`` commit engine. Pick the track whose programming model"
" fits your application:"
msgstr ""
"``fluxent.decl`` 与 ``fluxent.imp`` 共享同一个保留式 Fluxent 宿主、原生 Direct2D/DirectWrite "
"控件、无障碍支持以及原子化 ``XtkBatch`` 提交引擎。请根据应用场景选择适合的编程模型："

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:69
msgid "Dimension"
msgstr "对比维度"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:70
msgid "Declarative (``fluxent.decl``)"
msgstr "声明式（ ``fluxent.decl`` ）"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:71
msgid "Imperative (``fluxent.imp``)"
msgstr "命令式（ ``fluxent.imp`` ）"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:72
msgid "**Programming model**"
msgstr "**编程模型**"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:73
msgid "Unidirectional Model–View–Update (MVU) loop driven by ``flux_run``."
msgstr "由 ``flux_run`` 驱动的单向 Model–View–Update（MVU）循环。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:74
msgid ""
"Retained ``XtkScene`` handles, atomic ``XtkTxn`` transactions, and C "
"event callbacks."
msgstr "持有保留式 ``XtkScene`` 句柄，通过原子化 ``XtkTxn`` 事务与 C 事件回调驱动。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:76
msgid "**Entry point & headers**"
msgstr "**入口函数与头文件**"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:77
msgid ""
"``flux_run(&cfg, &model, update, view)`` with ``<fluxent/fluxent.h>`` and"
" ``<xtk/xtk.h>`` builders."
msgstr "``flux_run(&cfg, &model, update, view)`` ，配合 ``<fluxent/fluxent.h>`` 与 ``<xtk/xtk.h>`` 构建器。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:79
msgid ""
"``flux_app_create`` + ``flux_app_attachhost`` + ``xtk_scene_fromhost`` "
"with ``<xtk/xtk_controls.h>``."
msgstr "``flux_app_create`` + ``flux_app_attachhost`` + ``xtk_scene_fromhost`` ，配合 ``<xtk/xtk_controls.h>`` 。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:81
msgid "**UI construction & updates**"
msgstr "**界面构建与更新方式**"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:82
msgid ""
"``view()`` returns a lightweight ``XtkEl *`` tree derived from ``Model``;"
" the reconciler computes and commits the minimal ``XtkBatch`` diff "
"automatically."
msgstr "``view()`` 根据当前 ``Model`` 返回轻量 ``XtkEl *`` 描述树，协调器自动计算并提交最小 ``XtkBatch`` 变更。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:85
msgid ""
"Your code opens an ``XtkTxn``, calls typed ``xtk_*_create`` functions "
"with ``.set`` bitmasks, saves ``XtkCtrl`` handles, and calls "
"``xtk_*_set*`` setters directly."
msgstr "开启 ``XtkTxn`` 事务，通过带 ``.set`` 位掩码的 ``xtk_*_create`` 创建控件、保存 ``XtkCtrl`` 句柄，并直接调用 ``xtk_*_set*`` 更新属性。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:88
msgid "**Event handling**"
msgstr "**事件处理**"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:89
msgid ""
"Controls post ``XtkMsg`` values; state transitions live in a single "
"``update(model, msg)`` function."
msgstr "控件投递 ``XtkMsg`` 消息值，所有状态转移集中在 ``update(model, msg)`` 函数中完成。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:91
msgid ""
"Controls invoke ``XtkEventFn`` callbacks attached via ``xtk_*_on*`` or "
"``xtk_txn_on``; callbacks mark state dirty and update target controls."
msgstr "控件触发由 ``xtk_*_on*`` 或 ``xtk_txn_on`` 绑定的 ``XtkEventFn`` 回调函数，在回调中标记脏状态并更新目标控件。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:93
msgid "**Strengths**"
msgstr "**优势**"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:94
msgid ""
"Concise code; automatic synchronization between state and UI; automatic "
"control lifetime management; straightforward conditional layouts."
msgstr "代码简明；界面与状态自动保持一致；自动管理控件生命周期；条件分支与动态布局直观清晰。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:96
msgid ""
"Direct per-property writes; explicit control over transaction boundaries "
"and ``XtkCtrl`` lifetimes; stable C ABI used by language bindings."
msgstr "按属性定点直写；显式掌控事务边界与 ``XtkCtrl`` 句柄生命周期；同时也是多语言绑定所使用的稳定 C ABI。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:98
msgid "**Considerations**"
msgstr "**需要权衡之处**"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:99
msgid ""
"Evaluates ``view()`` after message batches (use ``xtk_memo_region`` or "
"``xtk_static_region`` to cache large unchanging subtrees)."
msgstr "在每批消息处理后重新求值 ``view()`` （大型静态子树可通过 ``xtk_memo_region`` 或 ``xtk_static_region`` 缓存复用）。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:101
msgid ""
"Requires explicit ``.set`` property bitmasks, ``XtkLocalId`` to "
"``XtkCtrl`` handle resolution, and manual UI state updates."
msgstr "需要显式填写 ``.set`` 属性位掩码、将 ``XtkLocalId`` 解析为 ``XtkCtrl`` 句柄，并手动维护状态到控件的同步。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:105
msgid "How to Choose"
msgstr "选型建议"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:107
msgid ""
"**Choose Declarative (** ``fluxent.decl`` **) as the default** when "
"starting with Xent or building desktop applications, forms, settings "
"panels, multi-step wizards, and developer tools."
msgstr ""
"**默认优先选择声明式（** ``fluxent.decl`` **）** ：适合初次上手 Xent，以及开发桌面应用、"
"表单、设置面板、多步向导与各类开发工具。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:110
msgid ""
"**Choose Imperative (** ``fluxent.imp`` **)** when integrating Xent into "
"an existing callback- or tick-driven C engine, issuing high-frequency "
"targeted property writes per frame, or writing a foreign-language binding"
" over Xent's C ABI."
msgstr ""
"**在以下场景选择命令式（** ``fluxent.imp`` **）** ：需要将 Xent 接入已有的回调驱动或帧驱动 C 引擎、"
"每帧对少量控件执行高频定点属性写入，或基于 Xent C ABI 编写其他语言绑定。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:116
msgid "Step 4: Create, Install Dependencies, Build, and Run Your First App"
msgstr "第 4 步：创建项目、安装依赖、编译并运行第一个应用"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:118
msgid ""
"Create a new project from your chosen template (use ``-t fluxent.decl`` "
"for declarative, or ``-t fluxent.imp`` for imperative):"
msgstr ""
"使用所选模板生成新项目（声明式使用 ``-t fluxent.decl`` ，命令式使用 ``-t fluxent.imp`` ）："

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:126
msgid ""
"This generates ``xmake.lua`` and ``src/main.c`` configured for C23, the "
"``xent-repo`` package repository, and the Windows GUI subsystem."
msgstr ""
"该命令会自动生成配置好 C23 标准、 ``xent-repo`` 包仓库与 Windows 窗口子系统的 ``xmake.lua`` 和 ``src/main.c`` 。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:129
msgid ""
"Configure Xmake with the root directory of your extracted ``llvm-mingw`` "
"installation (the parent folder containing ``bin``, such as ``C:\\llvm-"
"mingw``):"
msgstr ""
"将 Xmake 工具链指向解压后的 ``llvm-mingw`` 根目录（即包含 ``bin`` 的上一级目录，例如 ``C:\\llvm-mingw`` ）："

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:136
msgid "*(On ARM64 Windows, pass* ``-a arm64`` *.)*"
msgstr "*（在 ARM64 Windows 上请传入* ``-a arm64`` *。）*"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:138
msgid ""
"Install the dependencies declared in ``xmake.lua``—``xmake require`` "
"downloads and builds ``fluxent 0.3.3`` together with ``xent-kit 0.3.3``, "
"``xent-core 0.3.3``, and ``cwinrt 0.3.1``:"
msgstr ""
"安装 ``xmake.lua`` 中声明的项目依赖—— ``xmake require`` 会自动下载并编译 ``fluxent 0.3.3`` "
"及其传递依赖（ ``xent-kit 0.3.3`` 、 ``xent-core 0.3.3`` 与 ``cwinrt 0.3.1`` ）："

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:148
msgid ""
"The initial ``xmake require`` compiles all four packages from source and "
"caches them locally. Run ``xmake require --list`` at any time to view the"
" installed packages and versions."
msgstr ""
"首次执行 ``xmake require`` 会从源码编译并缓存这四个包。随时可运行 ``xmake require --list`` 查看已安装的依赖包与版本。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:152
msgid "Build and run the application:"
msgstr "编译并运行应用："

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:159
msgid ""
"A native Mica-styled window titled **hello** opens with a ``Counter`` "
"heading, ``Value: 0``, and ``−``, ``+``, and ``Reset`` buttons. After "
"editing ``src/main.c``, run ``xmake`` and ``xmake run`` to rebuild "
"incrementally; run ``xmake require`` again whenever you update "
"``add_requires`` in ``xmake.lua``."
msgstr ""
"此时会打开一个带 Mica 材质、标题为 **hello** 的原生窗口，包含 ``Counter`` 标题、 ``Value: 0`` "
"以及 ``−`` 、 ``+`` 、 ``Reset`` 按钮。后续修改 ``src/main.c`` 后，只需执行 ``xmake`` 与 "
"``xmake run`` 即可增量编译运行；当更新 ``xmake.lua`` 中的 ``add_requires`` 时再运行一次 ``xmake require`` 。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:165
msgid "Next Steps"
msgstr "后续阅读"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:167
msgid "Continue with the guide for your track:"
msgstr "按照你选择的开发路线继续深入："

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:169
msgid ""
":doc:`declarative` — Learn the Elm MVU loop, walk through the "
"``fluxent.decl`` template, and work with layout containers, ``xtk_fmt``, "
"inputs, and virtualized lists."
msgstr ""
":doc:`declarative` —— 先掌握 Elm MVU 单向循环，再逐行解析 ``fluxent.decl`` 模板、布局容器、"
" ``xtk_fmt`` 动态字符串、输入控件与虚拟化列表。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:172
msgid ""
":doc:`imperative` — Walk through the ``fluxent.imp`` template, "
"``XtkScene``, atomic ``XtkTxn`` transactions, ``.set`` property bitmasks,"
" and event callbacks."
msgstr ""
":doc:`imperative` —— 逐行解析 ``fluxent.imp`` 模板、 ``XtkScene`` 场景、原子化 ``XtkTxn`` 事务、"
" ``.set`` 属性位掩码与事件回调。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:175
msgid ""
":doc:`concepts` — Understand how ``xent-core``, ``xent-kit``, and "
"``fluxent`` fit together, and how ``flux_controls_use`` keeps executables"
" small."
msgstr ""
":doc:`concepts` —— 了解 ``xent-core`` 、 ``xent-kit`` 与 ``fluxent`` 的协作方式，"
"以及如何用 ``flux_controls_use`` 裁剪可执行文件体积。"
